But we need to ensure the old condition captures "occurred only once". Using indexOf == lastIndexOf and not -1. So condition: \old(this.indexOf(v) != -1 && this.indexOf(v) == this.lastIndexOf(v)). However after removal, we want this.contains(v) true.

Thus assert: assert (\old(this.indexOf(\old(this.get(index))) != -1 && \old(this.indexOf(\old(this.get(index))) == \old(this.lastIndexOf(\old(this.get(index)))))) => this.contains(\old(this.get(index)));

