Simplify: assert (\old(this.indexOf(\old(this.get(index))) == \old(this.lastIndexOf(\old(this.get(index))))) && \old(this.indexOf(\old(this.get(index))) != -1)) => this.contains(\old(this.get(index)));

But if indexOf returns -1, then lastIndexOf also -1, equality holds but not present. So we need also not -1. So condition: \old(this.indexOf(v) != -1 && \old(this.indexOf(v) == \old(this.lastIndexOf(v)))).

Thus final assert.

